# Vesuva enters as a copy of Bot2's Dark Depths (with ten ice counters: the copied "enters with" applies, CR 614.12, 707.9a),
# and Bot1 removes one with the copied "{3}: Remove an ice counter" (the positive control). Then Blood Moon. CR 305.7: a
# land whose subtype an effect sets "loses all abilities generated from its rules text, its old land types, and any copiable
# effects affecting that land" - the three sources of the abilities it loses. The copy effect itself, a layer-1 effect
# (CR 613.2a), is untouched: the name, supertypes and card type it gave stay (Blood Moon's ruling: it changes no name or
# supertype). So Vesuva is a legendary snow Land - Mountain named Dark Depths, with its nine ice counters, that taps for {R},
# has no "{3}: Remove an ice counter" and no state trigger. Bot2's Dark Depths likewise.
# The legend rule (CR 704.5j) still sees the name: on turn 7 Bot1 plays its own Dark Depths, which under the Moon enters with
# no ice counters (its "enters with" is lost, Blood Moon's ruling, CR 614.12) and does not trigger though it has none; Bot1
# keeps it and Vesuva goes to the graveyard. No Marit Lage is ever made.
# This settles known issue KI-51: "any copiable effects" is the third source of the abilities a land loses, not a loss of
# the copy effect.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Vesuva
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Blood Moon
Dark Depths
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Dark Depths
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Dark Depths.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Vesuva.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Dark Depths)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Counters.Ice = 10
Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Activate(Ability: Remove)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Counters.Ice = 9
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Blood Moon.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Subtypes = Mountain
? Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Supertypes = Legendary; Snow
! Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Activate(Ability: Remove)
Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Activate(Ability: Add {R})
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Dark Depths.Play
Bot1.Choose(Dark Depths#2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Turn = 7
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Blood Moon; Dark Depths
Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Counters.Ice = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Subtypes = Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Vesuva
Bot2.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Counters.Ice = 10
Bot2.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Subtypes = Mountain
Bot2.Battlefield.Dark Depths.Supertypes = Legendary; Snow
Stack.Count = 0
